Package: muvrix
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libmpv2 (>= 0.35.0) | libmpv1
Description: Modern native desktop media player
 Muvrix is a high-performance desktop media player written in Rust and powered by libmpv.
 Features include:
  * Hardware-accelerated decoding and presentation
  * Interactive 10-band audio equalizer with Bauer crossfeed and dynamics normalization
  * Custom video shaders and HDR calibration
  * SQLite-backed media catalog with FTS5 search
  * Gapless playback and cross-format playlist queues
  * Resilient network streaming with auto-reconnection
  * Full D-Bus MPRIS v2 media controls and display sleep inhibition
